From 0ff504f3015a770b5f04994d54b7782b149ef6e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yogesh Sevda <yogesh@example.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 21:03:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add upgraded knife sprite

Resolves #126.

Knife's stab and every heavy-flurry strike switch to a fancier
gold-guard blade (knife_upgraded.png) once upgraded, same shape as
the base knife, cut from the existing steel-weapons.png sheet
already in the project (no new attribution needed).

Follows the same resolveTexture() pattern already used for the
upgraded sword: KnifeWeaponComponent.resolveTexture() picks
UPGRADED_TEXTURE once isUpgraded() is true, wired into the shared
baseSpec() so it applies to every strike type.
